      "zh": "她唱得多好啊！"
    }
  ],
  "tip": [
    {
      "id": "p1",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "how 是常考单词，常出现在对划线部分提问的句型转换练习中，所以学生一定要掌握 how, what, where, why, which 等词的转换用法："
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p2",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "划线划在 twice a year 上，用 How often 提问"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p3",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "划线划在 twice 上，用 How many times 提问"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p4",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "划线划在 for twenty minutes 上，用 How long 提问"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p5",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "划线划在 until 8 o’clock 上，用 How long 提问"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p6",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "划线划在 since 1918 上，用 How long 提问"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p7",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "划线划在 in 1918 上，用 When 提问"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p8",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "划线划在 in twenty minutes 上，用 How soon 提问"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p9",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "划线划在 at 7 o’clock 上，用 What time 提问"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p10",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "划线划在 fifty miles an hour 上，用 How fast 提问"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p11",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "划线划在 fifty minutes’ walk 上，用 How far 提问"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p12",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "划线划在 English 上，用 What language 提问"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p13",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "划线划在 English or Chinese 上，用 Which language 提问"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p14",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "划线划在 to do 上表示目的，用 Why 或 What … for 提问"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p15",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "划线划在 on the tenth floor 上，用 Where 或 Which floor do you live on? 或 On which floor 提问"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p16",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "划线划在 5 dollars 上，用 How much is …?/How much does … cost?/What’s the price of …? 句型提问"
        }
      ]
    }
